-- PROVISIONAL R-Q1 / R-Q2: `EACH` is NOT a keyword. It is recognised only as
-- the second word of `HENCE FOR EACH`, so a program may still use it as a name.

EACH MEANS 3

#EVAL EACH PLUS 1

GIVEN EACH IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
twice EACH MEANS EACH TIMES 2

#EVAL twice 4

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Tenant HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign HAS signer IS AN Actor

-- ... and in the same file, the marker still reads as the fork
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`sign, and note each signature` MEANS
    EVERY Tenant t
        MUST   Sign (EXACTLY t)
        WITHIN 14
        HENCE FOR EACH FULFILLED
